    "description": {
      "value": "Ripples move constantly through a roaring potion, a cloudy liquid that growls when you open its container. Drinking it gives you access to two other activations for 1 hour.\n\nActivate (1 Action)\nYou gain the effects of a bullhorn spell. You can Dismiss the activation.\n\nActivate (1 Action)\nFrequency: once every 1d4 rounds\nYou emit a scream in a 15-foot cone that deals 4d4 sonic damage. Each creature in the area can attempt a DC 24 Fortitude saving throw.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and is frightened 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and is frightened 2.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
